  "instructions": [
    "Heat the olive oil in a comal or large skillet over medium heat.",
    "Add the chopped red onions and cook until they are softened and lightly browned, about 8 minutes.",
    "Add the minced garlic and grated ginger and cook for an additional 1 minute, stirring constantly.",
    "Add the rest-meat and cook until it is browned on all sides, about 5 minutes.",
    "Add the smoked paprika, cumin, coriander, salt, and black pepper, and stir to combine.",
    "Add the chopped fresh parsley, honey, and lemon juice, and stir to combine.",
    "Reduce heat to low and simmer, covered, for 45 minutes or until the rest-meat is tender.",
    "Serve hot, garnished with additional parsley if desired."
